{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文台預測，本港明日（11月1日）漸轉多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨，市區最低氣溫約25°C，新界再低一兩度。</p><p>日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約28°C。</p><p>吹和緩東風，初時離岸風勢清勁。</p><p>展望下周一（2日）部分時間有陽光。</p><p>隨後一兩日風勢較大。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.997662+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T09:34:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.875358+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064602+00:00","content_hash":"7ca335dc915bfd78974c022fc03da43add86b259a678cf38a8232f4fcebe6e3f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}